<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain H1 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain H1 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net					    2,048  vs	   2,166</p>
<p>    Operating				    4,277  vs	   4,036</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 3,543  vs	   3,524</p>
<p>    Exceptional			 charges  514  vs   charges 442</p>
<p>    Financial expense			    554  vs	     406</p>
<p>    Cashflow				     5,053  vs	   4,560</p>
<p>    Turnover				    40,003  vs	  34,955</p>
<p>NOTE - Saint-Gobain issued its half-year results in a statement. The turnover rise reflects new units Ball Foster, Carborundum, Winter and Cerasiv.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
